# Normalise all text to LF in the repository AND in the working tree.
#
# Not cosmetic. Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites text files to CRLF,
# and any tool that compares this repo against another byte-for-byte reports
# every file as different. That is precisely what happened when comparing two
# real theme repos: 49 files looked like they had diverged and were in fact
# identical apart from line endings.
#
# Drift detection and content diffing both rely on byte comparison, so line
# endings must be deterministic everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
